      "m_displayImage1": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_B_NPC.dds",
      "m_displayImage2": "",
      "m_clientTags": [],
      "m_genericEvents": [],
      "m_autoQualify": false,
      "m_autoComplete": false,
      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You are an unusual thing, but the knowledge of the Eldritch is free to all with the ability to ask for it.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Lapona_Olosohpa_AH-FORB_049.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752283,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Convenient. Then we seek the knowledge of how you destroyed the Tritons.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ione_Virga_AH-FORB_084.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752248,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "We have not destroyed the Tritons. Look around you. We may have stolen their city for ourselves, but every day they fight to reclaim it.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_Olisihpa_AH-FORB_032.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1727108,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Safe in the Deep they strike at us with beasts, knowing we have no means of striking back!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_Olisihpa_AH-FORB_033.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1727108,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "No means... yet. My lower laponas work diligently to that end, but lack resources. We are guiding our soldiers now to acquire them.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Lapona_Olosohpa_AH-FORB_050.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752283,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I see. Then if I am understanding this framework correctly, we could wait for your soldiers to finish their task, or complete it ourselves.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-FORB_083.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752246,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "If you seek to aid us, the laponas need material from the enemy on which to test their machinations. The streets are overrun with such foes.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Soulik_Olisihpa_AH-FORB_034.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1727108,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Or, perhaps, attempt to snatch by surprise and trickery, a creature in the surrounding waters.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Scientist_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Lapona_Olosohpa_AH-FORB_051.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752283,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-YELLOW-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "So we can fish for Triton samples or take them from each of the creatures in the streets. Understood.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Ione_Virga_AH-FORB_085.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752248,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
